\newlabel{fig:training}{{1}{3}{\textbf {Three-phase grokking arc.} The three phases—memorisation (blue), plateau (orange), and grokking transition (green)—are annotated consistently across all figures. Training accuracy reaches 100\% early while test accuracy stays near random chance until the abrupt transition. Test loss peaks above the random-chance baseline during the plateau, confirming the lookup-table solution actively suppresses generalisation before the algorithmic switch occurs}{figure.caption.1}{}}
